{"content": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>\n@import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;700;800&display=swap\");\n.arcadia-sourcing{font-family:Inter,sans-serif;direction:ltr;}\n.hero-sourcing{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0d0d0d,#1a1a1a,#1a0a00);color:#fff;padding:80px 20px;text-align:center;}\n.hero-sourcing h1{font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:800;color:#c9a84c;margin-bottom:16px;}\n.hero-sourcing p{font-size:1.1rem;color:#ddd;max-width:700px;margin:0 auto 30px;}\n.btn-wa{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#25D366;color:#fff;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:50px;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;margin-top:20px;}\n.section{padding:60px 20px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;}\n.section-title{font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:800;color:#1a1a1a;text-align:center;margin-bottom:36px;}\n.section-title span{color:#c9a84c;}\n.products-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:20px;}\n.product-card{background:#fff;border:2px solid #f0e6cc;border-radius:14px;padding:24px 18px;text-align:center;}\n.product-card h3{font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:8px;}\n.product-card p{color:#666;font-size:.9rem;}\n.price-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.95rem;}\n.price-table th{background:#c9a84c;color:#fff;padding:12px;text-align:center;}\n.price-table td{padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0e6cc;text-align:center;}\n.price-table tr:nth-child(even){background:#fdf8ee;}\n.faq{max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;}\n.faq-item{border-bottom:1px solid #f0e6cc;padding:16px 0;}\n.faq-q{font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:8px;}\n.faq-a{color:#555;line-height:1.7;}\n.cta-box{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a1a,#1a0a00);color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:60px 20px;}\n.cta-box h2{color:#c9a84c;font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:12px;}\n.cta-box p{color:#ddd;margin-bottom:24px;}\n</style>\n<div class=\"arcadia-sourcing\">\n<div class=\"hero-sourcing\">\n<h1>🚗 Import Auto Parts from China</h1>\n<p>We connect you with the largest OEM and genuine parts suppliers in <a href=\"https://arcadia-tour.com/en/china-main-en/\">China</a> — guaranteed quality, factory prices, fast shipping.</p>\n<a href=\"https://wa.me/77064007561?text=Hello%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20inquire%20about%20importing%20auto%20parts%20from%20China\" class=\"btn-wa\" target=\"_blank\">💬 Chat on WhatsApp</a><span class=\"arc-local-office-phone\" style=\"display:block;margin-top:12px;font-size:15px;\">Arcadia WhatsApp: <span dir=\"ltr\">+7 706 400 7561</span></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Available <span>Products</span></h2>\n<div class=\"products-grid\">\n<div class=\"product-card\"><h3>⚙️ Engines & Transmissions</h3><p>Engines, gearboxes, engine block components</p></div>\n<div class=\"product-card\"><h3>🔋 Batteries & Electrical</h3><p>Batteries, alternators, starters, wiring</p></div>\n<div class=\"product-card\"><h3>🛞 Brakes & Suspension</h3><p>Discs, brake kits, shock absorbers, ball joints</p></div>\n<div class=\"product-card\"><h3>💡 Car Accessories</h3><p>LED lights, cameras, audio systems</p></div>\n<div class=\"product-card\"><h3>🏎️ Body Parts & Bumpers</h3><p>Bumpers, doors, hoods, windshields</p></div>\n<div class=\"product-card\"><h3>🔧 Filters & Oils</h3><p>Oil, air, and fuel filters in bulk</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Approximate <span>Prices</span></h2>\n<table class=\"price-table\">\n<tr><th>Product</th><th>Min. Quantity</th><th>Approx. Price</th><th>Notes</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Car Batteries 60Ah</td><td>20 pcs</td><td>$25–$40/pc</td><td>Brand dependent</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Brake Kit Set</td><td>50 sets</td><td>$8–$20/set</td><td>OEM / Aftermarket</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Oil Filters</td><td>100 pcs</td><td>$1.5–$4/pc</td><td>Multi-model</td></tr>\n<tr><td>LED Headlights</td><td>30 pairs</td><td>$15–$50/pair</td><td>H4/H7/9005</td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Frequently Asked <span>Questions</span></h2>\n<div class=\"faq\">\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><div class=\"faq-q\">Are the parts genuine or aftermarket?</div><div class=\"faq-a\">We supply both based on your request. Genuine parts come from authorized factory agents; aftermarket parts come from top certified Chinese OEM manufacturers.</div></div>\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><div class=\"faq-q\">What is the minimum order quantity?</div><div class=\"faq-a\">It depends on the product, but generally from $500 USD to start a combined order with other clients.</div></div>\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><div class=\"faq-q\">How long does shipping take?</div><div class=\"faq-a\">Sea freight: 25–35 days. Air freight: 5–10 days depending on weight and volume.</div></div>\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><div class=\"faq-q\">Do you handle customs clearance?</div><div class=\"faq-a\">Yes, we provide full customs clearance service and all required documentation.</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cta-box\">\n<h2>Ready to Start? 🚗</h2>\n<p>Message us now with the car model and parts needed and we will send you the best offer</p>\n<a href=\"https://wa.me/77064007561?text=Hello%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20inquire%20about%20importing%20auto%20parts%20from%20China\" class=\"btn-wa\" target=\"_blank\">💬 Chat on WhatsApp</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->", "_elementor_data": ""}